hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2116","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''dhoke-baaz, ehsan jataney wala aur bakheel (kanjus) jannat mein nahin dakhil hongey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"2117","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Quran aur ilme-faraaiz seekho aur logon ko sikhaao isliye ke main wafat paney wala hun''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : is hadees mein iztirab hai."
"2118","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''momin bholaa-bhaala aur shareef hota hai, aur faajir dhoke baaz aur kamina khaslat hota hai.''"
"2119","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''aadmi ka apney baal bachchon par kharch karna sadqa hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin Amr , Amr bin Umayya Zamri aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
"2120","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''sab sey behtar Dinar wo Dinar hai, jisey aadmi apney ehal aur ayaal par kharch karta hai, aur wo Dinar hai jisey aadmi apney jihad ki sawari par kharch karta hai, aur wo Dinar hai jisey aadmi apney Mujahid sathiyon par kharch karta hai.''  Abu-Qulaba kehtey hain : aap ney baal-bachhon key nafqa (akhrajaat) sey shuruaat ki phir farmaya : ''us aadmi sey bada ajr aur sawab wala kon hai jo apney chhotey bachchon par kharch karta hai, jin key zariey Allah Taala unhen haram chizon sey bachata hai aur unhen maaldaar banata hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2121","jab Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ye hadees bayan farma rahey they to meri aakhon ney aap ko dekha aur kanon ney aap sey suna , aap ney farmaya : ''jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta hai wo apney mehman ki izzat kartey huye uska haq ada kerey.''  Sahaba ney arz kiya, mehman ki izzat ayr takrim aur Aaw-bhugat kiya hai? padhi. aap ney farmaya : ''eik din aur eik raat , aur mehman nawaazi teen din tak hai aur jo iskey baad ho wo sadqa hai, jo shakhs Allah aur  aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho, wo achchhi baat kahey ya khamosh rahey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2122","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''ziyaafat (mehman nawaazi) teen Deen tak hai, aur mehman ka Atiya (yani uskey liye takalluf ke saath khaney ka intizam karna) eik din aur eik raat tak hai, uskey baad jo kuchh is par kharch kiya jaeyga wo sadqa hai, mehman key liye jayez nahin ke mezban key paas (teen din key baad bhi) thehra rahey jis sey apney mezban ko pareshani aur mashaqqat mein dal dey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Malik bin Anas aur Les bin Saad ney is hadees ki riwayat Saeed Maqbari sey ki hai. 3- abu-Shuraih Khuzai ki nisbat Kaa'bi aur Advi hai, aur unka naam Khuwelid bin Amr hai. 4- is bab mein Aaisha aur Abu-Hurera Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain. 5- (لا يثوي عنده) ka matlab ye hai ke mehman ghar waley key paas thehra na rahey taake is par giraan guzrey. 6- (الحرج) ka maana (الضيق) (tangi hai) aur (حتى يحرجه) ka matlab hai (يضيق"
"2123","Aap ney farmaya : ''bewa aur miskeen par kharch karney wala Allah ki raah mein jihad karney waley ki tarah hai, ya us aadmi ki tarah hai jo din mein roza rakhta hai aur raat mein ibadat karta hai."
"2124","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''har bhalai sadqa hai, aur bhalai ye bhi hai ke tum apney bhai sey khush mizaaji key sath milo aur apney dol sey uskey dol mein pani dal do.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai,"
